      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the Rust port, we don\u0027t control the `vm_ops` for VMAs, so we can\u0027t implement this in the same way, unless we\u0027re fine doing it lazily like we\u0027re doing with ownership. Is that fine?\n\ncc: @elsk@google.com",
