      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T22:33:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess if only unmap operation is lazy that should be ok for out usecases because we are listening for these events to reset buffer protection on the first access and mmap() should happen before the munmap(). We do use these events in the buffer aging but I guess late unmap notification should not be critical for that.",
